    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2513" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Andes</span></b> , is, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a village near
			Mantua</i>, <i>the birthplace of Vergil</i>, now <i>Pietola;</i> hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Andīnus</span></b> , a, um, <i>of</i> or <i>from Andes</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Andinus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Vergil</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					8, 595</span></i>
			.</div>
